title: 'pallet-oracle: remove sp-std and make the median provider macro self-contained'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Removes the `sp-std` dependency from `pallet-oracle`. The exported
    `create_median_value_data_provider!` macro no longer requires callers to depend on `sp-std` or
    to have `vec!` in scope; it uses the new hidden `pallet_oracle::__private` re-exports instead.
crates:
- name: pallet-oracle
  bump: minor
